# The published CI images (ADR-0106 addendum): one line per image tag,
# "<tag> <digest>", added after .github/workflows/ci-image.yml publishes it
# (its summary prints the line). vendor/setup_ci_image.sh --pull takes the
# image of the current tag by this digest, and builds it when none is
# listed. Lines of tags no longer in use may be removed.
